{
    "title": "Blue Archive: Epic Anime rpg",
    "description": "Join Blue Archive, a fantasy RPG with gacha, strategy, and anime school battles!\r\n\r\nYou have been appointed as an advisor to the Federal Investigation Club, Schale, located in Kivotos, where the epic high school stories, adventures, and journeys with anime girls are about to unfold. Kivotos is a huge academy city where numerous high school academies are clustered together.\r\nResolve the endless incidents with epic high school girls. Enjoy the gacha life in Kivotos with various epic girls, and build special memories with them throughout the battles in this epic journey!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Achieve victory in this epic animated game by leading a team of high school girls in a dynamic gacha world, and prove your RPG strategy skills. 3D real-time anime rpg battle, adventure, and journey of epic high school girls with detailed rpg animations and skill cutscenes will keep you glued to the screen!\r\nConsider your team\u2019s abilities, terrain, strategy, and synergy from each girl to guide them to victory in every epic battle and adventure. Show your rpg strategic leadership in the Blue Archive journey!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The more you get to know girls through the journey, the more charming your anime girls get\r\nThe more time you spend with each girl in the story through epic battles, the deeper your bond with each epic girl be.\r\nInteract using the in-game messenger, Momo Talk, and discover new charming secrets about animated girls \r\nVarious anime students are waiting for you in the Blue Archive world to be their Sensei in an academic adventure and their journey!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 An exciting epic anime rpg story that gets you curious about how it will all unfold in this academic world!\r\nLoveliness x Students x Friendship\r\nAn unpredictable epic rpg story in the anime game of Blue Archive about the anime girls' friendship, love, and thrilling military action rpg adventures!\r\nDiscover a miracle within these anime girls' daily high school academy lives through relationship stories and journeys that can reveal their innermost feelings in this epic anime game of Blue Archive, as well as sub-stories that show the epic daily lives of various clubs in this anime world!\r\n\r\nExperience the academic high school life as a sensei with various epic high school girls in Blue Archive!\r\n\r\nFollow Us:\r\nOfficial Site: https://bluearchive.nexon.com/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/EN.BlueArchive\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/EN_BlueArchive\r\nYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsrnDYrkovQhCCE8kwKcvKQ\r\n\r\nNote: An internet connection is required to play this anime world.\r\n*For the best anime gaming experience, the following specs are recommended: Android OS 9.0 or higher / Galaxy Note 8 or higher / 6GB RAM required\r\n\r\nBy downloading this anime game, you are agreeing to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.\r\n- Terms of Service: http://m.nexon.com/terms/304\r\n- Privacy Policy: http://m.nexon.com/terms/305\r\n\r\n\u25a3 App Permission Information\r\nIn order to provide the services below, we request certain permissions.\r\n\r\n[Optional Permission]\r\nSave Photo / Media / Files: To save game execution files and videos, and upload photos/videos\r\nCamera: To take photos or record videos for upload\r\nPhone: To collect phone numbers to send promotional text messages\r\nNotifications: To allow the app to send service notifications\r\n\u203b Granting or denying optional permissions does not affect gameplay.\r\n\r\n[Permission Management]\r\n\u25b6 Android 6.0 or Higher - Go to Settings > Applications, select the app, and toggle permissions\r\n\u25b6 Under Android 6.0 - Update the OS version to revoke permissions, or uninstall the app\r\n\u203b If the app does not request consent for permission, you can manage the permission through the steps above.\r\n\u203b This app offers in-app purchases. You can disable this feature by adjusting your device settings.",
